# QAForge does not call any AI API itself. These variables are only read by the
# Claude Code and Codex CLIs that you launch (directly, or via `lab.py session`).
# The default is to sign in to each CLI with your subscription; leave these unset then.
# Copy to .env only if you prefer API-key auth. .env is ignored by Git.

# Claude Code (Anthropic). Optional; subscription login is the default.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Codex (OpenAI). Optional; ChatGPT login is the default.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
